<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c}</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">This is to inform you that the application titled </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> has been successfully </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">submitted</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> to the&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!IndividualApplication.Account}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;on&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!IndividualApplication.AppliedDate}</b></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Should any additional documents or clarifications be
required, you will be notified promptly.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your continued collaboration and support.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

